  "No sources yet. Until you add one, the app plays what you already have — anything in Downloads, and any magnet or torrent file you open yourself.": "Weli il ma jirto. Ilaa aad mid ku darto, barnaamijku wuxuu ciyaaraa waxa aad hore u haysatay — wax kasta oo Soo dejinta ku jira, iyo magnet ama fayl torrent oo aad adigu furto.",
  "No storage settings on this device. Format the drive as FAT32 on a computer — every Android box accepts it.": "Qalabkan ma laha dejinta kaydka. Diskka ku habee FAT32 kombuyuutar — sanduuq kasta oo Android wuu aqbalaa.",
