  "What language the app is in, and what language film and show descriptions are fetched in.": "Luqadda barnaamijku ku jiro, iyo luqadda sharraxaadda filimada iyo taxanaha lagu soo qaato.",
  "What sits behind the app": "Waxa barnaamijka ka dambeeya",
