  "Your watch history, favourites, watchlist, sources and every preference here, written to a single {file}. Carry it to another device and restore it there, or keep one against the day this one is wiped.": "Taariikhdaada daawashada, kuwa aad jeceshahay, liiska daawashada, ilaha iyo doorasho kasta oo halkan, oo lagu qoray hal {file}. U qaad qalab kale oo halkaas ku soo celi, ama mid u hay maalinta kan la tirtiro.",
