  "{device} couldn't open that link. It may have expired, or that device may have no connection of its own.": "{device} ma furi karin isku xirkaas. Waxaa laga yaabaa inuu dhacay, ama qalabkaas uusan lahayn xiriirkiisa gaarka ah.",
  "{device} couldn't reach this device — a firewall here is blocking port {port}.": "{device} ma gaari karin qalabkan — firewall halkan ku yaal ayaa xiraya dekedda {port}.",
